      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 1370401569,
      "text": "Ochna schweinfurthiana is a shrub or small tree belonging to the family Ochnaceae. It is represented in open deciduous woodlands in Tropical Africa."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Ochna schweinfurthiana",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ochna_schweinfurthiana",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 29406059,
      "text": "Ochna schweinfurthiana adalah perdu atau pohon kecil yang termasuk dalam famili Ochnaceae. Tumbuhan ini ditemukan di hutan gugur terbuka di Afrika Tropis."
    }
  },
  "sections": {
    "uses": {
      "en": {
        "source": "Wikipedia (en): Ochna schweinfurthiana § Uses",
        "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ochna_schweinfurthiana#Uses",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
        "revision": 1370401569,
        "heading": "Uses",
        "text": "The species is cultivated as an ornamental plant partly due to its bright yellow flowers.\nIn Northern Cameroon, native healers pound the stem bark of the species to treat malaria fever while root, leaves and stem bark extracts are used in decoctions to aid the wound healing process.",
        "truncated": false
      },
      "id": {
        "source": "Wikipedia (id): Ochna schweinfurthiana § Kegunaan",
        "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ochna_schweinfurthiana#Kegunaan",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
        "revision": 29406059,
        "heading": "Kegunaan",
        "text": "Spesies ini dibudidayakan sebagai tanaman hias sebagian karena bunganya yang berwarna kuning cerah.\nDi Kamerun Utara, tabib asli menumbuk kulit batang spesies ini untuk mengobati demam malaria, sementara ekstrak akar, daun, dan kulit batang digunakan dalam rebusan untuk membantu proses penyembuhan luka.",
        "truncated": false
      }
    }
  },
